                                  LICENSES/LicenseRef-UnifiedAutomation-SLA-2.5.txt


1. LicenseRef-UEI-Proprietary
-------------------------------
   Built into the binaries:
   UeiDmapEngine.cpp                UeiDmapProvider.cpp
   UeiDmapProviderBrowse.cpp        UeiDmapProviderCall.cpp
   UeiDmapProviderEvents.cpp        UeiDmapProviderHistoryRead.cpp
   UeiDmapProviderReadWrite.cpp     UeiDmapProviderSubscription.cpp
   UeiOpcServer.cpp

   Installed files:
   /etc/opcua/settings.conf            /etc/systemd/system/ueiopc.service
   /etc/ueiopc.xml                     /usr/bin/UeiOpcServer
   /www/cgi-bin/ueiopc_ui.cgi          /www/ueiopc.html

   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] Almost none of the UEI files have a
   copyright or license header today. Add the SPDX header shown below to
   each file.


2. LicenseRef-UnifiedAutomation-SLA-2.5
   Copyright (c) Unified Automation GmbH. All rights reserved.
-----------------------------------------
   Statically linked into /usr/bin/UeiOpcServer:
   libserverlib.a, libbaselib.a, libserverprovider.a, libmodels_*.a,
   libdatalogger.a from ueiopcuasdk (Unified Automation C++ SDK 1.3.5)

   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] Redistribution of the SDK inside
   UeiOpcServer is allowed only under UEI's purchased Unified Automation
   runtime / binary developer licenses (SLA 2.5 sections 1.2/1.3). Confirm
   the license count/type covers every shipped unit.


External components (not included in this directory)
----------------------------------------------------
UeiOpcServer dynamically links libuastack.so (ueiopcuasdk) and OpenSSL
(openssl recipe). ueiopc.html loads jQuery / jQuery UI shipped by ueiroot-
wwwfs (MIT).


Files not built/installed for the ARM (SoloX) target
----------------------------------------------------
Other directories of the UeiOpcUa SVN module (opcua_sdk is packaged by
ueiopcuasdk) are not covered by this summary.



